  lines:
  - '* you wanna have a bad time?'
  - '* What the hell is your issue?'
  - '* Hey!^10\n* No swearing!'
  - '* You should listen to your\n  mother.'
  - '* YES!! LISTEN TO THE\n  KING!!!'
  - '* Wait...^10\n* Is that older me?'
  - '* ...^20\n* Where am I?'
  - '* I don''t know!'
  - '* ...'
  - '* <color=#ff0000ff>It''s time.</color>'
  - '* NO IT ISN''T, LUCIFER.^05\n* IT IS NOT THE PERFECT\n  TIME TO PLAY.'
  - '* Yeah, you''re right.^10\n* My bad.'
  - '* And here we end off this\n  weird NPC dialogue with\n  <color=#ffff00ff>BATTLE TEXT</color>.'
  - '* A^02h^02h^02.^02.^02.^10\n* Battle text...^05\n* A very crinkly sound.'
